i untuk kebaikan dirinya sendiri. Dan kepada Allah-lah tempat kembali.","enText":"And no bearer of burdens will bear the burden of another. And if a heavily laden soul calls [another] to [carry some of] its load, nothing of it will be carried, even if he should be a close relative. You can only warn those who fear their Lord unseen and have established prayer. And whoever purifies himself only purifies himself for [the benefit of] his soul. And to Allah is the [final] destination.","readText":"wa l\u0101 taziru w\u0101ziratuw wizra ukhr\u0101, wa in tad'u mu\u1e61qalatun il\u0101 \u1e25imlih\u0101 l\u0101 yu\u1e25mal min-hu syai`uw walau k\u0101na \u017c\u0101 qurb\u0101, innam\u0101 tun\u017cirulla\u017c\u012bna yakhsyauna rabbahum bil-gaibi wa aq\u0101mu\u1e63-\u1e63al\u0101h, wa man tazakk\u0101 fa innam\u0101 yatazakk\u0101 linafsih, wa ilall\u0101hil-ma\u1e63\u012br","audio":"https:\/\/everyayah.com\/data\/Alafasy_64kbps\/035018.mp3","juz":22,"manzil":5,"page":436,"ruku":378,"hizbQuarter":175,"sajda":false},{"verseId":19,"ayahText":"\u0648\u064e\u0645\u064e\u0627 \u064a\u064e\u0633\u0652\u062a\u064e\u0648\u0650\u0649 \u0627\u0644\u0652\u0627\u064e\u0639\u0652\u0645\u0670\u0649 \u0648\u064e\u0627\u0644\u0652\u0628\u064e\u0635\u0650\u064a\u0652\u0631\u064f \u06d9","indoText":"Dan tidaklah sama orang yang buta dengan orang yang melihat,","enText":"Not equal are the blind and the seeing,","readText":"wa m\u0101 yastawil-a'm\u0101 wal-ba\u1e63\u012br","audio":"https:\/\/everyayah.com\/data\/Alafasy_64kbps\/035019.mp3","juz":22,"manzil":5,"page":437,"ruku":378,"hizbQuarter":175,"sajda":false},{"verseId":20,"ayahText":"\u0648\u064e\u0644\u064e\u0627 \u0627\u0644\u0638\u0651\u064f\u0644\u064f\u0645\u0670\u062a\u064f \u0648\u064e\u0644\u064e\u0627 \u0627\u0644\u0646\u0651\u064f\u0648\u0652\u0631\u064f\u06d9","indoText":"dan tidak (pula) sama gelap gulita dengan cahaya,","enText":"Nor are the darknesses and the light,","readText":"wa la\u1e93-\u1e93ulum\u0101tu wa lan-n\